### Noise Profile Adaptation (Phase 12)
```yaml
noise_profile_adaptation:
  enabled: true  # Whether adaptation is enabled
  update_frequency: "24h"  # How often profiles are updated
  adaptation_algorithm: "cma-es"  # CMA-ES gradient-free optimization
  minimum_feedback_entries: 100  # Minimum entries before update
  improvement_threshold: 0.1  # Minimum 0.1% improvement to trigger update
  profile_rollback_on_degradation: true  # Rollback if quality drops <85%
```

## Real-Time Filtering Pipeline (Phase 6 Component 5)

### Real-Time Filtering Configuration
- `real_time_enabled": true (whether real-time filtering is enabled, default: true)
- `latency_target_ms": 100 (maximum acceptable latency in milliseconds, default: 100)
- `throughput_target_tokens_s": 500 (target throughput in tokens/second, default: 500)
- `batch_size": 50 (processing batch size for real-time mode, default: 50)
- `streaming": true (whether to use streaming processing, default: true)

### Real-Time Filtering Workflow
```
1. Terminal output arrives in streaming fashion
2. Each batch of 50 tokens (configurable) is processed through NER pipeline
3. Entity classification performed via spaCy NER ( < 50ms per batch)
4. ANSI code stripping performed ( < 20ms per batch)
5. Repetitive pattern detection performed ( < 30ms per batch)
6. Entropy analysis performed ( < 30ms per batch)
7. Agent-specific noise profile applied ( < 10ms per batch)
8. Filtering decisions applied and output generated
9. Quality gating: if quality < 90%, reduce stripping aggressiveness
10. Output delivered with real-time latency < 100ms
```

### Latency Optimization
```
- spaCy NER inference: ~20ms per 100 tokens (CPU), ~5ms per 100 tokens (GPU)
- ANSI code stripping: ~5ms per 100 tokens (regex-based)
- Repetitive pattern detection: ~15ms per 100 tokens (pattern matching)
- Entropy analysis: ~10ms per 100 tokens (Shannon entropy calculation)
- Agent profile application: ~5ms per 100 tokens (dictionary lookup)
- Total per-batch latency: < 60ms (CPU), < 20ms (GPU enabled)
- Target overall latency: < 100ms per 100 tokens
```

